      howToRun: 'Open in prayer + read the Scripture (3): read Proverbs 16:32 and Ephesians 4:26 aloud. | The big idea (10): the lawyer\u2019s laws are the Proverbs — walk the ruled spirit, the waterfall, presence. | Go deeper (10): the house — caged vs esteeming, the repair cycle, the tank, kind vs nice; practice ONE validation exchange in pairs. | Reflect together (10): use the prompts; make room for anyone in a hard season at home. | Take it with you (2): each person names their one move for the week out loud.',
