        'Believe the spiritual realm first (it is the platform\u2019s own foundation): "spirits fighting spirits" and "settled in the spirit before the physical" are Ephesians 6:12 / Daniel 10:13 / the altar-and-field of L22 \u2014 honor the frame, then bound it: the fourth-kingdom (Daniel 2:43) is a pattern to watch not a date to set, "second heaven" is inference (2 Corinthians 12:2 names the THIRD), and the fall is sin/death/new-birth, not a named DNA edit.',
