      howToRun: 'Open in prayer + read the Scripture (3): read Acts 1:7-8 and 1 Thessalonians 4:18 aloud \u2014 the redirect and the purpose; they govern everything after. | The big idea (10): the camps named in five minutes without a fight (the chart is a map of positions, not a menu of gospels), then the camp-independent commands. | Go deeper (10): run ONE viral claim through the two tests together \u2014 text (Revelation 6:2 read aloud) and language (stephanos) \u2014 then through the fruit test; let the room feel the difference between weighing and mocking. | Reflect together (10): use the prompts; expect real fear in the room \u2014 someone has lost sleep over a video \u2014 and let 24:6\u2019s "be not troubled" and 21:4\u2019s wiped tears do their work. | Take it with you (2): each person commits to the fruit test on the next end-times content they meet, and reads Revelation 21:1-4 aloud at home once this week.',
