        'James 4:7 says submit FIRST, then resist. Where have you tried to resist a struggle from a place of pride rather than surrender — and what changed when you humbled first?',
        'If your identity is His workmanship by grace (Ephesians 2:8-10) and not your output, what would you stop striving to prove or control this week?',
        'Who is the trusted friend that can see the bias you cannot (Proverbs 27:17; Ecclesiastes 4:10) — and is there someone you resent that Matthew 5:44 is asking you to pray for, to loosen your own grip?',
