        'The teaching (Kokotajlo): recursive self-improvement -> possible "intelligence explosion"; a secretive high-stakes race among labs (he names OpenAI, Anthropic, others); his distrust of the leaders; "Plan A" (slow down, transparency, international deals, citizens’ dividend).',
        'THREE-TIER HONESTY (DR-0100): state the established (fast advance, real safety-vs-race tension, his costly exit); flag the FORECASTS (odds like "70%", dates 2027/2040) as opinion; attribute motive-judgments to him -- judge by FRUITS (Matthew 7:20), never presume the heart (Proverbs 16:2).',
        'The Babel mirror: a self-amplifying tower to "make us a name," needing no God -- "nothing will be restrained from them, which they have imagined to do" (Genesis 11:4-6); root: "ye shall be as gods" (Genesis 3:5).',
        'Posture = neither panic nor worship: God holds the times (Daniel 2:21; Psalm 2:4; 2 Timothy 1:7); trust no prince with unchecked power (Psalm 146:3; Psalm 118:9); transparency + testing (Luke 12:2; 1 Thessalonians 5:21).',
        'The real "alignment problem": power/knowledge without wisdom -- "knowledge puffeth up" (1 Corinthians 8:1); "the fear of the LORD is the beginning of wisdom" (Proverbs 9:10). Steward tools toward people (Genesis 1:28; Galatians 6:10); "except the LORD build the house" (Psalm 127:1).',
