        'Sovereignty is scriptural: "be not ye the servants of men" (1 Corinthians 7:23); "the borrower is servant to the lender" (Proverbs 22:7); "ye cannot serve God and mammon" (Matthew 6:24). Refuse being owned/extracted from.',
