        'Guardrail 1 -- stewardship, not a switch: owning it means guarding it (security, updates, diligence) -- "be sober, be vigilant" (1 Peter 5:8); "a prudent man foreseeth the evil" (Proverbs 22:3); "know the state of thy flocks" (Proverbs 27:23).',
