      howToRun: 'Open in prayer + read the Scripture (3): 1 Corinthians 7:23 and Zechariah 4:10 -- be not servants of men; do not despise small beginnings. | The big idea (12): digital sovereignty as a biblical instinct (don’t be owned/extracted from), then the humble core (start small) and the two guardrails (stewardship + love). | Go deeper (10): each person names one system that has quietly "mastered" them, and one small first step to more freedom. | Reflect together (8): use the prompts; steer between the two ditches -- dependence and overreach. | Take it with you (2): one small step toward owning a tool, and one way to aim your freedom at serving someone.',
