    // founded deeper. This is ALSO a conduct standard for Ari/Claude — render
    // honour to whom honour, name the overlooked contributor, never absorb the
    // family's credit (GOVERNANCE-EXECUTION-ADVISORY / DR-0111).
    // TRUST-BUT-VERIFY (DR-0190) — independently checked before teaching, not
    // taken from the session blurb's word:
    //   · The session is a practitioner talk, not a numbered study; Courtney
    //     Fleeger is a Champaign, IL designer/researcher (COLG's own city —
    //     COMMUNITY-FIRST). So the lesson attributes GENERALLY ("workplace
    //     research on recognition reports…") and asserts NO bare statistic — the
    //     research-integrity gate (DR-0100 tiers) is honored by construction.
