    // AND explicitly CORRECTS the amoral core by the Word (mastery WITHOUT manipulation;
    // power = servant-greatness; boldness = righteousness not seduction; the deceitful
    // heart is put OFF, not channeled). Greene’s claims are attributed to him (DR-0190);
    // the Word is the authority (DR-0098). Every verse KJV-verbatim from public/bible/kjv
