        'The program frame (Darrell, 2026-07-21): the Mind of Christ = thinking Yahweh’s perspective/way/knowledge/understanding (metacognition from Word directives) AND proving it in works (actions > words; faith without works is dead). Grounded in the app’s MIND-OF-CHRIST.md (NOTICE->TEST->CAPTURE->REDIRECT).',
        'MOVEMENT 1 — the mind is given, then renewed: "we have the mind of Christ" (1 Corinthians 2:16); "Let this mind be in you" (Philippians 2:5); "renewing of your mind... prove what is that good, and acceptable, and perfect, will of God" (Romans 12:2); "bringing into captivity every thought" (2 Corinthians 10:5); humbled under His higher thoughts (Isaiah 55:8-9; Proverbs 3:5-6).',
        'MOVEMENT 2 — daily Word is the INPUT/formation: "meditate day and night" (Psalms 1:2; Joshua 1:8); "Thy word have I hid in mine heart" (Psalms 119:11); the test-standard for thoughts (Philippians 4:8; Colossians 3:2). Daily reading re-patterns thinking and steadies the mind.',
        'MOVEMENT 3 — psychological SAFETY from the Father, Yahweh the 4th-dimensional King (DR-0097): "perfect peace... stayed on thee" (Isaiah 26:3); "perfect love casteth out fear" (1 John 4:18); "a sound mind" (2 Timothy 1:7); "refuge... in trouble" (Psalms 46:1). Regulation that overflows into relationships (2 Corinthians 1:4). Pairs with L43/L44.',
