        'MOVEMENT 5 — PROVEN in works (the hinge Darrell named): "doers of the word, and not hearers only" (James 1:22); "faith without works is dead" (James 2:17,26); hears AND does = the rock (Matthew 7:24); "why call ye me, Lord... and do not" (Luke 6:46). Obedience is the PURPOSE of the renewed mind (Romans 12:2 "prove... the will"). Pairs with L49 (learn by doing).',
