        'How does receiving your identity from Him — "in the image of God" (Genesis 1:27) — change the way you would think and act today?',
        '"Faith without works is dead" (James 2:26). What is ONE thing you already KNOW the Word says that you have been hearing but not doing (James 1:22; Luke 6:46) — and what is your first step to DO it this week?',
        'The renewed mind exists "that ye may prove what is that good... will of God" (Romans 12:2). Where is God asking you to PROVE (by doing), not just believe, His will right now?',
